retentious (communication concerns). Compare with C's communication difficulty and egocentric, plus unwillingness to further education.\n\nWe can argue that while both have communication concerns, B's stress handling and conscientiousness outweigh C's unknown stress and lack of development. So we shift vote to B.\n\nThus public message: I appreciate Sarah's points, but I think B is stronger due to proven stress resilience and conscientiousness, and I will vote for B. Provide evidence.\n\nNow produce METADATA_JSON with vote Candidate B.\n\nProceed."}
